    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address environmental issues (con:con46), while we company context does not explicitly detail environmental management policies or carbon footprint reduction strategies, we can emphasize we ability to propose solutions that optimize costs (req:req59) and contribute to reducing energetic consumption (req:req62), aligning with the client's environmental concerns where possible within we operational capabilities." ;
