    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By emphasizing these aspects of we company profile, we demonstrate a structured approach to managing legal eligibility, contractual compliance, and regulatory risk. a structured approach to managing legal eligibility, contractual compliance, and regulatory risk ensures that we tender response not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, consideration of environmental issues, security levels, and global cost management." ;
