    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing technology stack, performance benchmarks, and expertise in cloud architecture, API integration, and monitoring, we can design a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements for API interfaces, system integration, high availability, and sovereign hosting." ;
