    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we public procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions, we are well-versed in navigating the regulatory landscape of EU. our public procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions encompasses various procedure types such as open, restricted, competitive dialogue, and framework agreements, which will aid in ensuring compliance with the client's requirements. we default IP model, based on a work-for-hire principle where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment, aligns with the need for regulatory compliance by ensuring that intellectual property rights are clearly defined." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we capability to provide source code escrow through Logitas (France) offers an additional layer of security and contractual compliance." ;
